&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5942-C-1034 is to be contained within a steel cube with a triple lock door located at the north side of the cube with audio-less surveillance cameras, the steel cube is located at the center of SCP-5942-C-1034&#039;s containment chamber. Any instances of SCP-5942-B produced by SCP-5942-C-1034 are to be detained and SCP-5942 is to be informed.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;SCP-5942-C-1034 is sentient HP Omen Obelisk, it can access any digital file if SCP-5942 allows it to, it cannot access any non-digital files. SCP-5942-C-1034 appears to be sentient, it is considered a personal item of SCP-5942, though it is not stored in SCP-5942-D. SCP-5942-C-1034&#039;s personality is best described as self-keeping and aggressive. SCP-5942-C-1034 can turn any non-anomalous&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-906663-13&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; entity into an instance of SCP-5942-B by saying [Data Expunged]. SCP-5942-C-1034 displays a face that it uses to talk, if SCP-5942-C-1034 does not want to talk it will display a X or Go Away on its screen, personnel are advised to continue the conversation after 40 hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5942-C-1034 is currently connected via RF cable to a 13 black-and-white television. It has passed the Turing test, and is quite conversational, though very rude and hateful in tone. Due to the limited memory it has to work with, SCP-5942-C-1034 can recall information it has received within the previous six months, although it hasn&#039;t forgotten its desire to escape.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 5942-C-1034-1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5942-C-1034 has been &amp;quot;evolving&amp;quot; during the past 5 years and is now more intelligent and it&#039;s Cognitohazard has evolved to the point that it cannot&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 5942-C-1034-2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5942-C-1034 is all ways trying to breach containment and will do anything&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-906663-14&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; to breach containment&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
I am not letting SCP-5942-C-1034 tamper with this file for now. Sincerely SCP-5942&lt;/p&gt;
