&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-conquest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6724738&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608562660&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Conquest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6724738)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-conquest&quot;  &gt;Dr Conquest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. All personnel that applies for SCP-5942&#039;s containment must be identified to prevent a security breach&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. If SCP-5942 request a Human (D-class) or SCP-5942-2-A instance to become a instance of SCP-5942-2-B, SCP-5942-C-1034 is to be informed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. The radioactive beam is called by personnel &amp;quot;Atomic Ray&amp;quot; and the pulse is called &amp;quot;Nuclear Pulse&amp;quot;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. it is known that the ray and pulse has large amounts of Nuclear Energy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Sincerely&amp;#8230; SCP-5942&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. If SCP-5942 access a file and edits said file, it will often leave a footnote that says &amp;quot;Sincerely&amp;#8230; SCP-5942&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;Deleted by SCP-5942&amp;quot; or nothing&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. This is currently not possible due to SCP-5942 changing its physical properties to prevent an overload of radiation&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. Deleted by SCP-5942&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. Approximately 100 times slower.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. paralysis only affects 5% of exposed individuals&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. headaches caused by R-76 reach a temperature of 46 to 68°C&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. Probably from Bridge Dimension.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. excluding SCP-5942-A instances&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-906663-14&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;14&lt;/a&gt;. Except sacrifice SCP-5942&#039;s trust&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
