					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="anom-bar-container item-5942 clear-6 esoteric apollyon amida critical {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">5942</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level6</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">esoteric</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">apollyon</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">amida</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">critical</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Assigned Mobile Task Forces: <em>MTF Tau-5, MTF Epsilon-11, MTF Zeta-9, MTF Alpha-4, MTF Alpha-9, MTF Alpha-1, MTF Omega-7, MTF Beta-7, MTF Beta-4, MTF Nu-7, MTF Pi-1, and MTF Omega-12</em></strong></p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Access&nbsp;Previous&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Procedures</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;Document</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>SCP-5942 must be destroyed if possible. At this time, no means available to SCP teams are capable of destroying SCP-5942 only able to cause little to no physical damage. SCP-5942 should be contained within a 130&#160;m x 150&#160;m x 130&#160;m chamber with 1&#160;m reinforced acid resistant lead-lined steel plate lining all inside surfaces and is to be observed through reinforced glass or security cameras as to ensure that SCP-5942 is present. The containment chamber should be filled with <span style="text-decoration: underline;">fluoroantimonic acid, hydrochloric acid, and sulfuric acid</span> until SCP-5942 is submerged and incapacitated the remaining air should be filled with VX gas. Any attempts of SCP-5942 to move, speak, or breach containment should be reacted to quickly and with full force as called for by the circumstances. in the instance of containment breach personnel must wear gas mask to prevent inhaling VX gas.</p> <p>Personnel are forbidden to speak to SCP-5942, for fear of provoking a rage-state. All unauthorized personnel attempting to communicate to SCP-5942 will be restrained and removed by force unless approved of by O5-██ or Dr. █████████, interviews with SCP-5942 is temporarily prohibited. Testing of SCP-5942 is to be done in its old containment chamber.</p> <p>Due to its frequent attempts at containment breach, difficulty of containment and incapacitation, and high threat of Foundation Exposure, SCP-5942 is to be contained in [REDACTED]. The Foundation will use the best of its resources to maintain all land within fifty (150) kilometers clear of human development, anyone trying to settle within this area must be administered Class C anmistics or terminated if necessary. If SCP-5942 is to be transported to another site or area for any reason, it must be be heavily sedated and tranquilized to prevent containment breach.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>Access to SCP-5942 is restricted to those personnel who are certified by the on-site accredited logician, appointed by the Foundation European Regional Mathematical Studies Head. Prior to receiving access clearance to SCP-5942, Personnel must show they have knowledge over the basic Laws of their application:</p> <ul> <li>Personnel must have atleast Level 4 clearance to apply.</li> <li>Personnel's True Identity<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></li> <li>Personnel must have resistance to R-76.</li> <li>Personnel must have basic knowledge of</li> </ul> <p>SCP-5942's containment chamber is a 425&#160;m x 150&#160;m x 850&#160;m and is to be monitored by no more than 100 - 250 armed guards and 20 tanks. the chamber containing SCP-5942 must be ready to be filled with a mixture of <span style="text-decoration: underline;">VX, Sarin, Mustard Gas, Phosgene, Chlorine, and other Deadly Chemicals</span>.</p> <p>SCP-5942 is currently deemed Impossible to effectively contain for a long period of time, therefore it now freely roams the world.</p> <p>To maintain good relations with SCP-5942 and to prevent a possible XK-Class End-of-The-World scenarios and CK-Class Restructuring Scenario, Procedure 180 Halo must be followed to take the following precautions:</p> <ul> <li>Allowing it to freely roam the earth should it desire.</li> <li>Never insult SCP-5942.</li> <li>Always treat SCP-5942 with respect</li> <li>Prohibition of Termination Attempts.</li> <li>If SCP-5942 allows itself to be contained, it is to be given a 200&#160;m x 150&#160;m x 200&#160;m chamber located in Dim/Bio Unit in Site [Redacted] or Area [Redacted].</li> <li>Always give SCP-5942 a source of radiation such as Nuclear Waste, Nuclear Bombs, Uranium deposits, Plutonium, etc, and always have a backup source of radiation to give SCP-5942 as radiation is its <em>Food</em>.</li> <li>Always treat SCP-5942 with respect.</li> <li>Always grant its request (if any), unless it includes destruction of a city or harming of humans<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>.</li> </ul> <p>Although SCP-5942's behavior is unpredictable and can be aggressive or docile, procedure 180 Halo must be followed at all cost, failure to do any of the rules in Procedure 180 Halo, Procedure 018, to prevent multiple K-Class Scenarios, Procedure 018 must take place:</p> <ul> <li>Site-19 must be evacuated</li> <li>Site-19s on site nuclear bomb must be ready be detonated</li> <li>All anomalies in Site 19 must be transferred to another site/area</li> <li>Site 19 is to lock-down</li> <li>All MTF assigned to SCP-5942 are to engage with SCP-5942.</li> <li>If SCP-5942 goes to a city, the city is to be evacuated, all non-foundation personnel are to be administered amnestics</li> <li>Re-establishment of SCP-5942's past Containment Procedures.</li> <li>Ones SCP-5942 calms down SCP-5942's new Containment Procedures are to be re-established</li> </ul> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5942 is a large, vaguely reptile-like creature of unknown origin approximately 80 meters in height and 125 meter in length and has an estimated weight of around 150,000 to 200,000 tons. It has about 258 dorsal plates from head to tail. The entity appears to be extremely intelligent.SCP-5942 has always been observed to have extremely high strength, speed, and reflexes, though exact levels vary with its form. It can run at a top speed of 150]km/h, it's top speed when swimming is 300km/h.</p> <p>It has been observed to be able shoot a laser-like high velocity projectile mouth and back in the form of a blue or red radioactive beam or a pulse<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup>, this beam or pulse's temperature is hot enough to melt every thing around it, what the beam or pulse is made of is currently unknown<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup>, SCP-5942 is able to be able to control the weather, temperature, create objects, create new elements, and the ecosystem of the planet. It can create anything including other anomalies and living creatures, most of witch have anomalous properties and they often result in the creation of instances of SCP-5942-2-A. The roar of SCP-5942 is considered to be a cognitohazard, SCP-5942 controls the effects of the roar, the most common effects are [Data Lost]<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-5" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >5</a></sup>. SCP-5942 can access, edit, and delete any file in the world even if it is Expunged or Classified<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-6" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >6</a></sup>. It has its own personal army of entities and humans designated SCP-5942-2-B, these instances of SCP-5942-2-B are <em>[Redacted]</em> by <strong>SCP-5942-C-1034</strong> which serves as a [Data Lost] for SCP-5942-2-B instances. Its main form of offense is its claws, tail, &quot;Atomic Ray&quot;, and &quot;Nuclear Pulse&quot;, SCP-5942 is able to be able to control the weather at will, control its size, and control the <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><em><strong>Entire Universe</strong></em></span>. SCP-5942's respiratory system produces and breathes out large amounts of a Class F amnestic (R-76). (see Addendum 5942-L)</p> <p>SCP-5942's physical body can grow and change very quickly, it depends on the level of radiation in its body and SCP-5942's liking to change its form. SCP-5942 gains energy from the radiation it absorbs, it does not seem to have a digestive tract and seems to be able to turn radiation around it into its energy. aided by a set of filtering gills on its neck and inside its nostrils, which are able to remove usable matter from any liquid solution, enabling it to constantly regenerate from the acid it is contained in.SCP-5942 appears to have a hatred of all Humans, which has been expressed in several interviews during containment and can cause a ZK-Class Reality Failure Scenario.</p> <p>SCP-5942 displays polymorphic properties, it has 5 forms of itself that are known by the Foundation, but there maybe more as not much is known about the entity. In its 2nd form SCP-5942 is has a more <strong>wolf</strong> like appearance, jagged dorsal plates, 60 meters tall, 125 meters long, slimmer and is weaker but more agile.In its 3rd form SCP-5942 is has a more <strong>Dinosaur</strong> like appearance, pointy ears, small fangs, a secondary row of teeth, dorsal plates, 100 meters tall, 175 meters long, bulkier, more muscular and is stronger, more agile. If the levels of radiation in its body becomes to high SCP-5942 Enters its 4th form <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Burning</span>, in its burning form its body temperature reaches 15 million degrees celsius and will grow to the size 100 meters. This event occurred at the date (██,██,████). If its body temperature does not decrease in 1 - 2 days it will go into <span style="text-decoration: underline;">nuclear meltdown</span> during this SCP-5942's body will release a huge a mount of nuclear energy in a pulse witch will destroy the solar system.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-7" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >7</a></sup> SCP-5942's 5th form is approximately 5 Km in height and about 11 Km in length, it is slower but very powerful, its scale texture is that of tree bark, its teeth are 100 meters big, it has a force field surrounding it, and it can create a very destructive ray of radiation by swiping its tail. In this form SCP-5942 can control its size</p> <p>In case of containment breach, SCP-5942 is to be tracked and re-captured by all available Mobile Task Forces, and no teams with fewer than fifty (50) members are cleared to engage it. To date (██-██-████), attempted breaches have numbered at seven thousand nine hundred eighty-six (7,986), while successful breaches have numbered at seven thousand eight hundred forty-one (7,841). During a containment breach, SCP-5942 successfully breached containment and some of its tissue were recovered, the sample was examined and test has shown it's non-organic and is made of unknown material and <span style="text-decoration: underline;">weighs 5 tons</span>. Research on SCP-5942 has resulted in the creation of &quot;Jägers&quot; 8=75 meter tall piloted robots witch are still in testing, by request of the O5 council. Jägers are to be deployed to help contain SCP-5942. (see Document-5942-4)</p> <p>SCP-5942 was asked on (██-██-████) to prove that it was the creator of the Universe, it made a 5 meter by 5 meter sphere that looks like the earth and said &quot;This has microscopic organisms on its surface&quot;, the planet has a magnetic field and floats in mid-air and when put under a microscope has tiny Humanoids and animals on its surface, this however was [Data Lost] by SCP-5942 and stomps on it. 2 days later it made a tiny galaxy and said &quot;Name this whatever you want&quot; and puts it in its pocket dimension, after 2 minutes, the news broadcasted that a new galaxy was discovered and the description given was that of the galaxy that SCP-5942 created but was twice the size of the Andromeda Galaxy.</p> <p><strong>Discovery</strong><br /> SCP-5942 was discovered on March 1946 by the US navy at [Data Expunged], the US military used nuclear bombs to kill SCP-5942, SCP-5942 survived the nuclear bombs and [Data Lost]<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-8" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >8</a></sup></p> <p><strong>Addendum 5942-B: Termination Options:</strong><br /> <strong>Log of Experiment-5942-3:</strong> Dr. █████████ attempts to use SCP-409 on SCP-5942. General █████, General █████, and Dr. ██████ observing.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Begin Log</strong><br /> 05942: Dr. █████████ orders to start the experiment.<br /> 0400: SCP-5942 is transported into the containment chamber.<br /> 0500: SCP-409 is transported into test area.<br /> 0690: Exposure. SCP-5942's tail touches SCP-409.<br /> 1624: Crystallization begins, spreading extremely slower than normal.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-9" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >9</a></sup><br /> 2643: SCP-5942 shows signs of extreme pain, it's dorsal plates to glow red and begins to [Data Lost].<br /> 5419: Crystallization stops at 27% conversion. Crystallized area explodes, causing massive physical trauma to SCP-5942.<br /> 5432: SCP-5942 recovers from exposure. SCP-5942 begins regeneration, stating that it will kill all staff involved in Experiment-5942-3.<br /> <strong>End Log</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Addendum 5942-E: Termination Options:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5942 appears to now be immune to SCP-409. Use of other SCP items to terminate SCP-5942 must now first be tested recovered tissue samples of SCP-5942 before full-scale testing.</p> <p>In accordance the Dr. █████████'s recommendations,Dr. ████ and Dr. ██████ have requested permission to attempt the termination of SCP-5942 using SCP-682. The request was denied by O5-Command in fear of SCP-682 adapting to SCP-5942.</p> <p>It has been suggested by Dr. ████████ to use SCP-5943 in an attempt to kill SCP-5942. The test was denied by O5 Command.</p> <p><strong>Addendum 5942-G:</strong> Termination Log:<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/experiment-log-t-92563-oc5032">Experiment-Log-T-92563-OC5032</a></p> <p><strong>Document-5942-1:</strong> R-76<br /> SCP-5942 exhale large amounts of an aerosolized Class F amnestic, designated R-76, R-76 causes sedation, long-term paralysis<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-10" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >10</a></sup>, increased susceptibility to visual/audio stimuli, possible brain damage, difficulty breathing, fear of confined spaces (Claustrophobia), headaches<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-11" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >11</a></sup> and catatonic symptoms. It is colorless, odorless, and tasteless with an estimated R-76 for inhalation of 0.000005942ng•min. In well-ventilated or open air environments, risk of exposure to R-76 is slightly reduced about 0.005%. R-76 is typically undetectable in the bloodstream five (5) seconds following cessation of exposure. Reported sensations of disorientation, seizures, and severe Visual, Tactile and Auditory Hallucinations immediately following removal from environments saturated with the agent are similar to recreational use of numerous psychoactive substances and easily mistaken as such. Some individuals have some level resistance to the effects of R-76</p> <p><strong>Document-5942-2: Personality</strong><br /> SCP-5942 has a hate of humans because of pollution of the Earths environment. It Loves Planet Earth as its SCP-5942's Favorite planet and is hesitant to destroy the planet, it has its own personal dimension called SCP-5942-3. The entity likes the planet so much that it will stop at nothing to prevent its destruction, however it will do anything to prevent its death as it has said in Dr. <span class="dblock">Grant</span>'s interview that the Universe will be destroyed along with everything else it has created. Insulting SCP-5942 is strictly prohibited due to its reaction of rage and it will not calm down until the one who has offended it is killed by it.</p> <p><strong>Document-5942-3: Diet</strong><br /> SCP-5942's diet is mostly radiation but some times eats unknown organic matter<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-12" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >12</a></sup> as a replacement to radiation, when asked what is the organic matter it eats, SCP-5942 will say &quot;it is tasty&quot;. SCP-5942 has no apparent need to feed, it needs to feed on radiation to maintain its physical form, it is mostly unknown what its true form is due to its reply &quot;A Ghost&quot;, this may mean that its true form is that of a spirit like being.</p> <p><strong>Document-5942 -4: Jägers</strong><br /> Jägers are giant 50 - 70&#160;m tall robots armed with [Data Expunged]. Jägers are currently experimental and still requires field testing and is to be deployed to counteract SCP-5942 and help contain or kill it. The Jägers are [Data Expunged], and is to be piloted by 1 or 2 highly trained individuals.</p> <p><strong>Document-5942-5: Weakness</strong><br /> SCP-5942 is very sensitive to biological hazards and some memetic hazards. Biological hazard and memetic hazards often will incapacitate SCP-5942 for a short to a long period of time. The period of time that SCP-5942 is incapacitated depends on the biological hazard or memetic hazard it is exposed to.</p> <p><strong>Document-5942-6: Pocket Dimension</strong><br /> SCP-5942 has a &quot;Pocket Dimension&quot; that it uses to store SCP-5942-Cs, SCP-5942-C-1034 and other items it deems it owns. SCP-5942's &quot;Pocket Dimension&quot; SCP-5942-D.</p> <p><strong>Document-5942-7: SCP-5942-C-1034</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Level&nbsp;6/5942&nbsp;clearance&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;to&nbsp;access&nbsp;this&nbsp;file</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Welcome&nbsp;O5-13</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="anom-bar-container item-5942-c-1034 clear-6 esoteric 53 ekhi critical {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">5942-c-1034</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level6</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">esoteric</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">53</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">ekhi</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">critical</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5942-C-1034 is to be contained within a steel cube with a triple lock door located at the north side of the cube with audio-less surveillance cameras, the steel cube is located at the center of SCP-5942-C-1034's containment chamber. Any instances of SCP-5942-B produced by SCP-5942-C-1034 are to be detained and SCP-5942 is to be informed.<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong>Description:</strong>SCP-5942-C-1034 is sentient HP Omen Obelisk, it can access any digital file if SCP-5942 allows it to, it cannot access any non-digital files. SCP-5942-C-1034 appears to be sentient, it is considered a personal item of SCP-5942, though it is not stored in SCP-5942-D. SCP-5942-C-1034's personality is best described as self-keeping and aggressive. SCP-5942-C-1034 can turn any non-anomalous<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-13" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >13</a></sup> entity into an instance of SCP-5942-B by saying [Data Expunged]. SCP-5942-C-1034 displays a face that it uses to talk, if SCP-5942-C-1034 does not want to talk it will display a X or Go Away on its screen, personnel are advised to continue the conversation after 40 hours.</p> <p>SCP-5942-C-1034 is currently connected via RF cable to a 13 black-and-white television. It has passed the Turing test, and is quite conversational, though very rude and hateful in tone. Due to the limited memory it has to work with, SCP-5942-C-1034 can recall information it has received within the previous six months, although it hasn't forgotten its desire to escape.<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong>Addendum 5942-C-1034-1</strong><br /> SCP-5942-C-1034 has been &quot;evolving&quot; during the past 5 years and is now more intelligent and it's Cognitohazard has evolved to the point that it cannot<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong>Addendum 5942-C-1034-2</strong><br /> SCP-5942-C-1034 is all ways trying to breach containment and will do anything<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-578637-14" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >14</a></sup> to breach containment<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> I am not letting SCP-5942-C-1034 tamper with this file for now. Sincerely SCP-5942</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5941">SCP-5941</a> | SCP-5942 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5943">SCP-5943</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-conquest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6724738&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608562660" alt="Dr Conquest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6724738)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-conquest" >Dr Conquest</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. All personnel that applies for SCP-5942's containment must be identified to prevent a security breach</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. If SCP-5942 request a Human (D-class) or SCP-5942-2-A instance to become a instance of SCP-5942-2-B, SCP-5942-C-1034 is to be informed.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. The radioactive beam is called by personnel &quot;Atomic Ray&quot; and the pulse is called &quot;Nuclear Pulse&quot;</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. it is known that the ray and pulse has large amounts of Nuclear Energy.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. Sincerely&#8230; SCP-5942</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. If SCP-5942 access a file and edits said file, it will often leave a footnote that says &quot;Sincerely&#8230; SCP-5942&quot; or &quot;Deleted by SCP-5942&quot; or nothing</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. This is currently not possible due to SCP-5942 changing its physical properties to prevent an overload of radiation</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-8"><a href="javascript:;" >8</a>. Deleted by SCP-5942</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-9"><a href="javascript:;" >9</a>. Approximately 100 times slower.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-10"><a href="javascript:;" >10</a>. paralysis only affects 5% of exposed individuals</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-11"><a href="javascript:;" >11</a>. headaches caused by R-76 reach a temperature of 46 to 68°C</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-12"><a href="javascript:;" >12</a>. Probably from Bridge Dimension.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-13"><a href="javascript:;" >13</a>. excluding SCP-5942-A instances</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-578637-14"><a href="javascript:;" >14</a>. Except sacrifice SCP-5942's trust</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
