					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="anom-bar-container item-5871 clear-2 euclid none dark notice {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">5871</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level2</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">euclid</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">none</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">dark</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">notice</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5871 is to be kept in a standard humanoid containment cell at all times. Once a week, SCP-5871 is to be given a ball of clay to absorb. All personnel are not permitted to mould SCP-5871.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5871 is clay, moulded in the shape of a vaguely humanoid entity. SCP-5871 absorbs clay on contact. SCP-5871 lacks a nose, ears and arms. SCP-5871 is sapient and capable of verbal communication, however, SCP-5871 can’t structure sentences properly.</p> <p>A pink, spherical<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-67809-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> object has been found inside of SCP-5871’s chest, similar to the placement of the miniature earth inside of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-007">SCP-007</a>, however the object is completely submerged with the clay. When asked about this object, SCP-5871 displays extreme discomfort.</p> <p><strong>Added Description:</strong> As of ██/██/████, SCP-5871-A has displayed properties similar to <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-357">SCP-357</a>. Personnel dealing with SCP-871 are to be reminded of this.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7141604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608562660" alt="TheKidNamedCover" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7141604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover" >TheKidNamedCover</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-67809-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. SCP-5871-A</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
