&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5661&quot;&gt;SCP-5661&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;The Devil and the Maiden&amp;quot;) - The maiden wasn&#039;t probably made of iron. A story told by stormbreath.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3651&quot;&gt;SCP-3651&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;Chalk Children&amp;quot;) - No one of them had been used to wrote on a blackboard. Written by J Dune.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
